# hrhub dark mode theme (locked)

## Do NOT change

In `hrhub/app/globals.css`, under `.dark`:

- **`--primary` must stay `#2a3746`**
- **`--primary-foreground` must stay `#d8dce2`**
- **`--sidebar-primary` must stay `#2a3746`** (aligned with primary)

These are surface/button tokens on the blue-gray dark theme, not link accent colors.

## Readable text on dark tables

- Body cell text: `text-foreground` (or rely on `DataTable` default `text-foreground` on cells).
- **Never use `text-primary` for plain table text in dark mode** — primary blends into the row background.

## Links and green accent

- Use **`text-erp-accent`** / **`hover:text-erp-accent`** for interactive links in tables (maps to `--erp-accent`, green in both themes).
- Light mode: `--erp-accent` matches brand green; dark mode: same green for hover/links only.

## Reference

See `hrhub/docs/THEME.md` for the full token table.
